  "points": ["gp-conjunctions-basic", "gp-imperative", "gp-ile", "gp-icin"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "*Ve* (and), *ama* and *fakat* (but), *veya* and *ya da* (or) link words and sentences: *çay ve simit*, *ucuz ama güzel*. To offer a choice, Turkish asks with two *mI*: *Çay mı, kahve mi?* At the end of the meal: *Hesap, lütfen.*",
    "see": "gp-conjunctions-basic"
  },
